### MODE=TRACE — traceability matrix audit (replaces @TraceabilityChecker)

**Source agent:** v6.x @TraceabilityChecker.
**Behaviour:** unchanged. Reference `TraceabilityChecker.body.md.template` for the full 4-pass matrix logic.

